(key: "shifter/rageshaper/invulnerable-defenses", blueprint: "44ad5d0af1474c74a616723bfb5c13f5", name: "Invulnerable Defenses", summary: "From 2nd level, unarmoured or in light or medium nonmetal armour: +2 natural armour and DR 2/-, rising to DR 10/- and +4 natural armour at 20th.", guide: "shifter#invulnerable-defenses")
